<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>sono saki ni kimi wa nani wo nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

34
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>there was something beyond that, what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, which way is it?!</font>

38
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a faint scent of salt water...</font>

39
00:01:53,630 --> 00:01:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were almost there...</font>

40
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll use my Rasengan to...</font>

41
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! If it doesn't go well,
we'll be crushed under the ceiling.</font>

42
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, what should we do?!</font>

43
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, step backward.</font>

44
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

45
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phew, we're safe...!</font>

46
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko Sensei!</font>

47
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:34,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get moving...
It's already morning.</font>

48
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

49
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ships collecting funds
are in danger...!</font>

50
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've got to follow them
right away!</font>

51
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that ship!</font>

52
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go!</font>

53
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've had no contact
from the Ninja of the Leaf Village?</font>

54
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were told to
accompany the ship.</font>

55
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world happened?</font>

56
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Captain, we just received
communication.</font>

57
00:03:02,370 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

58
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I expect
from elite Ninja!</font>

59
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they finished the suppression
of the Demon of the Ocean last night.</font>

60
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent...
So now the ships are safe.</font>

61
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course.
Men, take your positions!</font>

62
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll depart.</font>

63
00:03:27,490 --> 00:03:32,520
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="30">Despair:</font></font>

64
00:03:27,490 --> 00:03:32,520
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="30">A Fractured Heart</font></font>

65
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful of the reef!</font>

66
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't see any ships that look like
those that collect funds in the port.</font>

67
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could they depart without us?</font>

68
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have they already fallen
into Amachi's scheme...?</font>

69
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:05,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Captain Hitode...</font>

70
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?!</font>

71
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something there!
The bottom of the ship...!</font>

72
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Confirm the enemy!</font>

73
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger!</font>

74
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What?</font>

75
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Full toward port!</font>

76
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't steer!</font>

77
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

78
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good. It won't move.</font>

79
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to hit, everyone.
Grab onto something!</font>

80
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This must be the attack from
the Demon of the Ocean?</font>

81
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for working hard
at transporting the funds.</font>

82
00:05:25,470 --> 00:05:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw you a while ago!</font>

83
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Identify yourself!</font>

84
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you hand this ship over
without resistance,</font>

85
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will save your life.</font>

86
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me!</font>

87
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's the Demon of the Ocean...
— A monster!</font>

88
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Illusion: Fire Jutsu.</font>

89
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

90
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

91
00:06:13,930 --> 00:06:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fire torture...!</font>

92
00:06:31,030 --> 00:06:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yoroi, take care of the rest.</font>

93
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

94
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm your opponent!</font>

95
00:07:04,770 --> 00:07:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, hang in there!</font>

96
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so nasty!</font>

97
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We meet again, weirdo!</font>

98
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, but I still have
something to ask you.</font>

99
00:07:19,330 --> 00:07:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Isaribi!</font>

100
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut it out already!</font>

101
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep this up and you'll really turn
into the Demon of the Ocean!</font>

102
00:07:28,970 --> 00:07:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it, Isaribi.</font>

103
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is right here.</font>

104
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said that Orochimaru left</font>

105
00:07:44,650 --> 00:07:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that research facility
a month and a half ago...</font>

106
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he go?</font>

107
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

108
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,
Orochimaru had a kid in tow.</font>

109
00:07:55,490 --> 00:07:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that the kid is
really excellent, unlike you.</font>

110
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

111
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:04,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something about you
just wasn't enough.</font>

112
00:08:04,330 --> 00:08:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you were abandoned,
I guess.</font>

113
00:08:11,970 --> 00:08:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isarirbi?!</font>

114
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

115
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi...</font>

116
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet you still understand
what I've been saying to you, Isaribi!</font>

117
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you care a bit after
tormenting everyone this much?</font>

118
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:15,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

119
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think nothing of...
even bringing you down...</font>

120
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:25,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a lie!</font>

121
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter to me
who gets injured...</font>

122
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or who drowns...</font>

123
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:43,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm satisfied as long as
I can return to being a human!</font>

124
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time to come
to yourself!</font>

125
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand painfully
enough how you feel...</font>

126
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:08,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... doing that...
It's not good!</font>

127
00:10:58,630 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi, you saved me.
You have a kind heart!</font>

128
00:11:24,330 --> 00:11:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty good for a Medical Ninja.</font>

129
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

130
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a little surprised that</font>

131
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you had enough time
to take your eyes off...</font>

132
00:11:41,470 --> 00:11:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

133
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too confident...</font>

134
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're useless.</font>

135
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:54,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long you think
you'll be doing this?</font>

136
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amachi...</font>

137
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just a kid.</font>

138
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why can't you finish him off
right away?</font>

139
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry. But...</font>

140
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't take it anymore.
Get out of my way!</font>

141
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it on.
I'll kill a damn monster like you!</font>

142
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:13,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Monster? Me?</font>

143
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

144
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You so easily injure
and kill people.</font>

145
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a monster wearing
human skin!</font>

146
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's so funny!</font>

147
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, what then?</font>

148
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not some half-monster
like Isaribi...</font>

149
00:12:35,730 --> 00:12:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm...</font>

150
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">further refined than her and
fully integrated for combat use!</font>

151
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

152
00:12:54,250 --> 00:12:55,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amachi...!</font>

153
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of my way!</font>

154
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:59,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an almost dead guinea pig...</font>

155
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

156
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we were supposed to dissect
and use her as material for experiments,</font>

157
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we took pity on her
and kept her alive.</font>

158
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after all,
she's terribly ungrateful and useless.</font>

159
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong... kid?</font>

160
00:13:24,950 --> 00:13:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! You're not only
