169
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:12,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what's wrong, little guy?</font>

170
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:19,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to come again, huh?</font>

171
