196
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:48,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then do as I say!</font>

197
00:16:52,190 --> 00:16:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good...</font>

198
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good...</font>

